---
source: crates/surfaces/cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Render the project's agents, skills, slash commands and hooks into a host's files, idempotently

Usage: specforge install [OPTIONS] <HOSTS>...

Arguments:
  <HOSTS>...
          The hosts to install into: claude-code, codex or cursor

Options:
      --dry-run
          Print the plan and write nothing

      --check
          Print the plan, write nothing, and exit 1 when anything would change (for CI)

      --force
          Rewrite a file install wrote that was edited since (never a file it did not write)

      --path <PATH>
          A path inside the project (the nearest directory at or above it holding specforge.json; none: the directory itself, with the default configuration)
          
          [default: .]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help
